# Use Base Development Rules

All AI agents in this methodology repository must follow `docs/base-standards.md` as the single source of truth.

Before planning or implementing, read:

- `docs/base-standards.md`
- Linked domain docs as relevant: `backend-standards.md`, `frontend-standards.md`, `documentation-standards.md`, `data-model.md`, `api-spec.yml`, `development_guide.md`, `openspec-tasks-mandatory-steps.md`
- The current OpenSpec change, if present
- The phase agent under `ai-specs/agents/`
- Matching skills under `ai-specs/skills/`

## Directives

- Hierarchy: docs → OpenSpec change → agent → skills → code
- Follow those linked docs. They are part of the rule set
- Vapi and other channels are adapters, never the application core
- Skills compose with OpenSpec; they do not replace `/ff`, `/apply`, or `/verify`
- English only for technical artifacts
- Frontend rules apply only when an operator/HITL UI exists
